      "content": "that makes sense. some of the people at the meeting are pretty upset though, they keep complaining about how it's going to ruin the \"character\" of the neighborhood and how it'll just cause traffic and stuff. is there a way to frame those concerns as just being outdated or something? like, how do i explain that those arguments don't really hold up against the benefits you mentioned?",
